    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/604e29359502e4dbd67bc50b0f696d61.avif?t=1732981315\" /></div><br>Jacob Miller's life is a mess, with no future.<br><br>Everything will change after receiving the invitation to participate in the last stage of a new food product.<br><br>During the ten days that the trial will last, the participants will undergo a strange program of physical and sensory stimulation based on a new way of understanding food production and human nutrition.<br><br>The trial will be carried out in full isolation at the Spira food and nutrition facility.<br><br>Be part of something that will change the future of humanity, be part of Spira.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/tvrojos.gif?t=1732981315\" /></div><br><br>INANIMA is a classic survival horror experience with a pixel art aesthetic. Solve puzzles, investigate secrets, and face nightmarish creatures as you fight to keep your life and sanity safe.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.poster.avif?t=1732981315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.webm?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.mp4?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed Pixel-Art aesthetics with dynamic lighting.<br></li><li>Combat system with a wide variety of ranged and melee weapons.<br></li><li>Aim at enemies' vital areas to deal more damage or shoot at their limbs to slow them down.<br></li><li>Use resources to upgrade your weapons and equipment. Make your weapons more powerful or precise.<br></li><li>Terrifying enemies with behaviors that will adapt to the environment.<br></li><li>Enemies are sensitive to light and sound.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/ad000f0994911245c0531396ab71cce3.poster.avif?t=1732981315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/ad000f0994911245c0531396ab71cce3.webm?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/ad000f0994911245c0531396ab71cce3.mp4?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/0842f8b9c375b1c4a14e72d019eda891.avif?t=1732981315\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/604e29359502e4dbd67bc50b0f696d61.avif?t=1732981315\" /></div><br>Jacob Miller's life is a mess, with no future.<br><br>Everything will change after receiving the invitation to participate in the last stage of a new food product.<br><br>During the ten days that the trial will last, the participants will undergo a strange program of physical and sensory stimulation based on a new way of understanding food production and human nutrition.<br><br>The trial will be carried out in full isolation at the Spira food and nutrition facility.<br><br>Be part of something that will change the future of humanity, be part of Spira.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/tvrojos.gif?t=1732981315\" /></div><br><br>INANIMA is a classic survival horror experience with a pixel art aesthetic. Solve puzzles, investigate secrets, and face nightmarish creatures as you fight to keep your life and sanity safe.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.poster.avif?t=1732981315\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.webm?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211000/extras/786b5ef6a0a4dd500fb21e96416fee91.mp4?t=1732981315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed Pixel-Art aesthetics with dynamic lighting.<br></li><li>Combat system with a wide variety of ranged and melee weapons.<br></li><li>Aim at enemies' vital areas to deal more damage or shoot at their 